      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It concentrates its mental energy and fires off\nmysterious waves called auras, which can crush\nboulders of large size to dust.",
