      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It controls waves known as auras, which are\npowerful enough to pulverize huge rocks.\nIt uses these waves to take down its prey.",
